  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "航運物流規劃概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO MARITIME LOGISTICS",
    "describe_ch": "隨著全球國際化的發展趨勢，國與國之間的進出口貿易皆須仰賴海空陸運輸來達成交易，而全球90%貨物，皆依靠海運，因此海運在產業供應鏈中扮演著重要的腳色，藉由探討現行臺灣海運物流實體運作模式，讓學生對海運物流有更深的認識及瞭解。",
    "describe_eh": "Along with the global development trend of internationalization, import and export trade between countries are rely on air, maritime, and land transportation to conclude the transaction and 90% of the world of goods, all depend on shipping, so maritime logistic plays an important role. This class lets the student have a clear concept of maritime logistics by exploring Taiwan shipping logistics.",
